Aerie-Purpose: Size the horizontal tab strip, address pill and scroll fades from the Aerie tokens, and follow the layout and density prefs.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/ui (layout_constants.cc, BUILD.gn), chrome/browser/ui/views/toolbar (toolbar_view.cc, BUILD.gn), chrome/browser/ui/views/location_bar (location_bar_view.cc, BUILD.gn), chrome/browser/ui/views/tabs/horizontal (horizontal_tab_strip_overflow_indicator_view.*, BUILD.gn), chrome/browser/ui/helium (helium_layout_state_controller.cc, BUILD.gn)
Aerie-Kind: hook

Issue #186. HeliumLayoutStateController sets the active horizontal metrics (aerie_sidebar::UpdateActiveHzMetrics) from the layout and density prefs, before the layout lock moves. GetLayoutConstant takes the tab height and the strip padding from them, the address pill is size-hz-address-pill wide (never narrower than size-hz-address-pill-min) and the scroll fades are size-hz-scroll-fade wide, painted in the frame colour.

